  Sections:
  - TextHeading: Welcome
    TextSubheading: 
    TextBody: 'This project is created from the Unity Project Template. '
    LinkName: Github.com/SamuelAsherRivello/unity-project-template-ar
    LinkUrl: https://github.com/SamuelAsherRivello/unity-project-template-ar
    PingObjectName: 
    PingObjectGuid: 
    MenuItemName: 
    MenuItemPath: 
  - TextHeading: Configure
    TextSubheading: 
    TextBody: It's best to playtest on your AR device (e.g. mobile phone).\n\nYou
      may use any Lightship-compatible target platforms. \nHowever, it is EASIEST
      to use an <B>Android</B> phone.\n\nMost setup is already completed for you.\n\nFinalize
      with these steps;
    LinkName: 1. Get 'API Key' From Lightship Site
    LinkUrl: https://lightship.dev/account/dashboard
    PingObjectName: 
    PingObjectGuid: 
    MenuItemName: 
    MenuItemPath: 
  - TextHeading: 
    TextSubheading: 
    TextBody: 
    LinkName: 
    LinkUrl: 
    PingObjectName: 
    PingObjectGuid: 
    MenuItemName: 2. Add 'API Key' To Lightship Settings
    MenuItemPath: Lightship/Settings
  - TextHeading: 
    TextSubheading: 
    TextBody: 
    LinkName: 3. 'Patch & Run' on Android via USB
    LinkUrl: https://docs.unity3d.com/Manual/android-AppPatching.html
    PingObjectName: 
    PingObjectGuid: 
    MenuItemName: 
    MenuItemPath: 
  - TextHeading: Build
    TextSubheading: 
    TextBody: Use 'Build And Run' once. This builds slowly.\n\nThen use 'Patch And
      Run' forever after.
    LinkName: 
    LinkUrl: 
    PingObjectName: 
    PingObjectGuid: 
    MenuItemName: Open Build Settings
    MenuItemPath: File/Build Settings...
  - TextHeading: Develop
    TextSubheading: 
    TextBody: After you have built with success, you can experiment with the provided
      samples Scenes and starter Scenes.
    LinkName: 
    LinkUrl: 
    PingObjectName: 
    PingObjectGuid: 
    MenuItemName: 
    MenuItemPath: 
  - TextHeading: 
    TextSubheading: 
    TextBody: Open the NianticLabs sample Scenes.
    LinkName: 
    LinkUrl: 
    PingObjectName: Scenes
    PingObjectGuid: ca5e717807acf4f0eac815ac612d2331
